00:28:00,960 --> 00:28:12,389
and you can imagine that's just for buildings and transportation obviously has to do something entirely different in how they line up the transportation network and ensure that those are maintained stable

275
00:28:12,389 --> 00:28:16,549
and places is also different using different attributes and comparisons.

276
00:28:16,549 --> 00:28:18,230
But that's how we ensure stability at overure.

